{
  "slug": "aikido",
  "name": "Aikido",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Aikido Security scanning for Claude Code — SAST, secrets, and IaC vulnerability detection powered by the Aikido MCP server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `issues` (List, count, summarize, or triage security issues from the Aikido security feed), `scan` (Runs an Aikido security scan on generated, added, or modified code files to detect SAST vulnerabilities and exposed…), `setup` (Configures the Aikido plugin by signing the user in through the MCP login tool and verifying the MCP…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `aikido-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install aikido@claude-plugins-official` from `AikidoSec/aikido-claude-plugin`.",
